# Generated reference data — NEVER committed.
#
# Two reasons, both non-negotiable:
#   1. It is other people's content. mccc_help.json is ~152 KB of Deaderpool's
#      verbatim MCCC tooltip strings; the *_schema.json files are setting names
#      and defaults extracted from MCCC and Kuttoe's mods.
#   2. It embeds local absolute paths (C:\Users\<account>\...), which would
#      publish the machine account name.
#
# All of it regenerates in seconds from a local install:
#     py mccc-config/scripts/extract_schema.py
#     py kuttoe-config/scripts/extract_kuttoe.py
# Generated files also drift out of date the moment a mod updates, so shipping
# the extractors rather than the extracts is the correct design regardless.
mccc-config/reference/mccc_help.json
mccc-config/reference/mccc_schema.json
kuttoe-config/reference/kuttoe_schema.json

# Generated reports about THIS user's library — personal, never committed.
# adult_inventory.json is a categorised list of the user's NSFW mods by name;
# report.json and the SFW plan enumerate their whole installed library.
sims4-doctor/scripts/adult_inventory.json
sims4-doctor/scripts/report.json
sims4-doctor/scripts/SFW_PROFILE_PLAN.txt
sims4-doctor/reference/
*_inventory.json
*_PLAN.txt

# Local scratch and caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.bak
reports/
